Yes. Now the laser gun.

00:34:36.560 --> 00:34:40.680
The man who invented this could rule the world, or save it if you prefer.

00:34:42.250 --> 00:34:44.350
Isn't that the kind of man you want to succeed you for?

00:35:02.300 --> 00:35:07.810
I gathered up all my self-doubts, and I rid myself of them by projecting them onto you.

00:35:08.230 --> 00:35:11.740
I have used you, Richard...

00:35:11.740 --> 00:35:12.240
Stop it, Father.

00:35:13.420 --> 00:35:16.590
...to protect myself, and I almost destroyed you.

00:35:16.730 --> 00:35:17.550
Forgive me, please.

00:35:17.830 --> 00:35:20.660
Don't... don't shut me out of your successes.

00:35:20.660 --> 00:35:23.000
I tried to shut you out of mine.

00:35:23.140 --> 00:35:23.820
Please forgive...

00:35:23.820 --> 00:35:24.260
Stop it!

00:35:24.600 --> 00:35:29.400
He does not forgive easily, Father.

00:35:30.190 --> 00:35:32.710
He has your small flaws as well as your great virtues.

00:35:35.320 --> 00:35:37.110
He will forgive me, won't he?

00:35:38.220 --> 00:35:38.960
I'll help him do.

00:35:39.770 --> 00:35:42.030
But quickly, Judith, please, quickly, I haven't too much time.

00:35:42.350 --> 00:35:44.210
I did not decide to retire.

00:35:45.410 --> 00:35:47.300
I am going to be retired.

00:35:49.010 --> 00:35:52.890
By a more final and just decision than I could ever make.

00:36:14.080 --> 00:36:14.300
doing.

00:36:15.860 --> 00:36:20.220
It's customary for one to comfort a broken enemy before you discard him.

00:37:58.796 --> 00:37:59.456
Once he'll come again.

00:38:00.092 --> 00:38:00.212
Bye.

00:38:01.116 --> 00:38:02.876
Can she live without air to breathe?

00:38:03.100 --> 00:38:05.580
Is there a perpetual supply of oxygen in a tumor?

00:38:05.840 --> 00:38:06.580
He'll come back!

00:38:19.292 --> 00:38:19.612
It should.

00:38:21.980 --> 00:38:22.820
Let me go.

00:38:23.548 --> 00:38:24.148
So I help.

00:38:25.564 --> 00:38:29.964
If I can do something, I'm sure, but not if I must remain here, it's horrible.

00:38:30.508 --> 00:38:34.428
tell me it's hopeless. That's all you ever had to give me words of hopelessness. Don't you ever run

00:38:34.428 --> 00:38:34.808
out of them?

00:38:35.660 --> 00:38:39.040
Do you have a perpetual supply of hopeless words in that tomb of yours?

00:38:41.324 --> 00:38:41.804
If...

00:38:42.316 --> 00:38:44.476
If there was such a creature...

00:38:45.292 --> 00:38:49.452
It may be roaming the streets, it may be killing them, someone should...

00:38:49.452 --> 00:38:51.252
Sit down, follow you, and be quiet!

00:39:00.410 --> 00:39:02.310
First, a thief and a friend from the other world.

00:39:02.980 --> 00:39:06.100
Well, you must do something for all of us, as well as for your wife.

00:39:06.120 --> 00:39:08.580
What can we do for my wife, Father? What can we do?

00:39:09.010 --> 00:39:10.130
Get help, Richard.

00:39:11.600 --> 00:39:14.420
Perhaps she can be reached from the room below.

00:39:14.880 --> 00:39:16.680
If the ceiling were to be cut away...

00:39:16.680 --> 00:39:18.960
The shield goes all the way down to the foundations of the house, Father.

00:39:19.560 --> 00:39:21.340
Down and down, probably all the way to...

00:39:21.620 --> 00:39:22.520
Stay, Father. Stay!

00:39:24.200 --> 00:39:25.680
I'll call, then, for help, huh?

00:39:25.950 --> 00:39:28.130
You can listen. I won't say anything incriminating.

00:39:29.750 --> 00:39:29.970
Can I...

00:39:30.924 --> 00:39:32.704
Can't I even call if I helped you out call?

00:39:33.196 --> 00:39:34.236
Call, call whom?

00:39:34.956 --> 00:39:35.496
The police.

00:39:36.236 --> 00:39:37.996
The leading scientist of the world.

00:39:38.732 --> 00:39:40.392
The faith healers, the magicians.

00:39:41.164 --> 00:39:42.824
Psychiatrists, munitions experts.

00:39:43.596 --> 00:39:44.376
Philosophers.

00:39:44.652 --> 00:39:47.352
The politicians, the image makers, funeral directors.

00:39:47.948 --> 00:39:49.148
A million government agencies!

00:39:49.612 --> 00:39:50.832
Whom do you call, Father?

00:39:51.212 --> 00:39:52.752
When you're trapped alive in your own tomb!

00:39:59.500 --> 00:39:59.860
Ture it.

00:40:00.700 --> 00:40:02.610
Pick it up. Try again, please.

00:40:04.220 --> 00:40:06.020
Movements and words accomplish nothing.

00:40:06.700 --> 00:40:08.780
I've only decreed the oxygen and the soul.

00:40:10.500 --> 00:40:11.260
Once more, please!

00:40:12.310 --> 00:40:14.950
Mrs. Dame, tell him it's useless.

00:40:15.190 --> 00:40:17.900
No, it isn't. He has to be still in our atmosphere.

00:40:18.740 --> 00:40:20.660
He couldn't have left without the shield to be incinerated.

00:40:20.860 --> 00:40:21.660
He knew that, Judith.

00:40:21.860 --> 00:40:24.020
Mrs. Dame, tell him to call the police.

00:40:29.000 --> 00:40:29.260
Richard!

00:40:30.000 --> 00:40:30.360
No.

00:40:31.400 --> 00:40:32.200
It's a state.

00:40:32.360 --> 00:40:35.820
A state can't execute me without getting me out of here.

00:40:36.450 --> 00:40:38.880
It's an illusion.

00:40:39.780 --> 00:40:40.720
Tell them I'm a murderer.

00:40:41.040 --> 00:40:43.880
And they'll rip me out of this thing for their bare hands.

00:40:44.360 --> 00:40:45.920
To keep me from escaping.

00:40:46.600 --> 00:40:47.640
They're a chamber.

00:40:57.560 --> 00:40:59.980
Don't be so much about it.

00:41:01.690 --> 00:41:06.950
All about it, I thought, a single one could protect our entire planet.

00:41:08.180 --> 00:41:10.720
Its radius is increased by merely deepening the pressure.

00:41:12.030 --> 00:41:13.610
An anti-weapon, he called it.

00:41:15.250 --> 00:41:16.430
I thought he told me everything.

00:41:17.230 --> 00:41:18.700
Now, of course, I realize it.

00:41:20.660 --> 00:41:23.180
He never told me how to remove it.

00:41:29.160 --> 00:41:29.980
No, in this world...

00:41:30.000 --> 00:41:40.130
will remove it. Nothing will remove it. Kill him prematurely.

00:41:55.450 --> 00:41:56.850
Dame and I put him in the cellar.

00:42:08.350 --> 00:42:09.930
I wanted proof that he'd been here.

00:42:11.100 --> 00:42:12.440
Your father would have wanted proof.

00:42:14.760 --> 00:42:18.440
Fathers often demand what strangers don't even expect.

00:43:22.140 --> 00:43:24.340
I'm going to bury it. You must not stop me.

00:43:28.410 --> 00:43:28.990
Your proof.

00:43:29.600 --> 00:43:29.980
The police must...

00:43:31.490 --> 00:43:33.880
Police? Oh, no, of course not.

00:43:34.580 --> 00:43:35.760
No, it's none of their business.

00:43:37.030 --> 00:43:38.690
It belongs to the world of the prize givers,

00:43:39.230 --> 00:43:40.550
of the praises of greatness.

00:43:40.730 --> 00:43:43.130
And my son invented the agency that brought it here.

00:43:43.720 --> 00:43:46.280
He'll be splashed across a thousand chapters

00:43:46.280 --> 00:43:48.260
of the world's most honored history.

00:43:49.590 --> 00:43:52.170
It has a bullet in the base of its skull.

00:43:52.960 --> 00:43:54.460
My son didn't put it there.

00:43:56.190 --> 00:43:58.950
Great men are forgiven their murderous wives.

00:45:00.000 --> 00:45:05.610
I can forgive you, Judith, but I can't let you free.

00:45:31.630 --> 00:45:35.530
She accidentally broke the vein.

00:45:36.870 --> 00:45:43.630
My fluid, like your blood, dry in.

00:46:34.160 --> 00:46:48.710
I expected it to kill me, but it looked into my eyes and I heard myself say, and it said, I not.

00:47:10.500 --> 00:47:12.290
Judith, it's gone.

00:47:14.110 --> 00:47:14.610
You're free.

00:47:27.650 --> 00:47:29.980
We'll have to tell someone what...

00:47:30.000 --> 00:47:30.520
We've done.

00:47:30.700 --> 00:47:58.840
You said it was gone.

00:47:59.460 --> 00:47:59.980
It is gone.

00:48:00.000 --> 00:48:05.480
Judith. No, it's still here.

00:48:07.260 --> 00:48:16.750
Nothing will remove it. Nothing will ever remove it.

00:48:17.520 --> 00:48:19.760
It's here. I know it's here.

00:48:21.960 --> 00:48:29.920
See it? Here.

00:48:40.400 --> 00:48:50.860
I'll never remove it, I'll never remove it, I'll never remove it.

00:49:03.640 --> 00:49:16.530
When this passion called aspiration becomes lust, then aspiration degenerates, becomes vulgar ambition, by which sin the angels fell.
